My 3rd on NAO, and just barbarian remaining for the career role rainbow
(one of each role).

Thanks to zem and merlincorey for their bones, which eased my troubles
some (zem's was rough--see below).

Wound up polypileless, polyselfless, artiwishless although I wasn't
trying for any conducts.  Used 3 wishes.  Level 22 with a maximum of
213 hit points at ascension.

I gotta say, the double-damage from the Mirror is really nice.

Went to Minetown, where a lamp gave me nothing.  Dipped for excalibur
on the way to Sokoban, which yielded reflection (wore the Sokoban
amulet through ascension).  Then caught a break: the mines one level
below Minetown had a merlincorey bones file, obvious wizard bones
including CoMR.   While I only wore it for about 10 levels it was a
great boon in my development.  I found only 1 ?enchant weapon in the
early game, so used +2 excalibur for a long time.  Although I found a
magic marker, I also ran smack up against a mineflayer which eliminated
my knowledge of ?ew.

No bag of holding by the Castle, so I wished for a blessed greased
fireproof one there.  Found an =teleport control around here as well,
so I got teleportitis (never got TC intrinsically)

So I was still using +2 Excal when I reached Orcus, where zem had left
quite a nasty little bones file with Yeenoghu (who killed him), Orcus,
a nalfeshnee, and several other assorted nasties.  Orcus went down
quickly, Yeenoghu was forced upstairs, and I found in the bones file
(among other things):

+4 Frost Brand
The Eye (no use to me, lawful)
7 partly used candles
a bell

Looks like zem got killed by Yeenoghu on the way up in the ascension
run.  Ouch!

Took frosty with me, marked the vibrating square, cleared Vlad's, and
finally found ?enchant weapon there.  Finished out with reasonable
firepower.

The RNG had a little fun with me, giving several ?enchant weapon,
+magic mapping, and a magic lamp in Rodney's tower.

Did the "levelport into the Sanctum" trick which worked out rather
nicely.

Despite being lawful, only hit the mysterious force once on the way
out.

Had to fight to the 3rd altar, and wound up with only a few teleport
charges left, but "You survived".

